"Performance">省电</option></select></label><p>学习内容的语言不会随界面语言改变。</p><!----></div><!--]--></div></dialog><!--]--><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><!--[--><div><section class="page-heading"><div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="当前位置"><a href="/" class="">首页</a><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg><span>学习内容</span></nav><span class="eyebrow">学习内容</span><h1>找到今天想学的内容。</h1><p>从词汇、听读到表达，先选一个适合自己的起点。</p></div></section><section class="page-body"><div class="container"><div class="catalog-toolbar"><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="学习内容分类"><!--[--><button aria-pressed="true">全部</button><button aria-pressed="false">词汇与语法</button><button aria-pressed="false">听力与阅读</button><button aria-pressed="false">口语与写作</button><!--]--></div><label class="search-field"><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m16 16 5 5"/></svg><input type="search" value="" placeholder="想学什么？" aria-label="搜索学习内容"><button aria-label="清空搜索"><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6"/></svg></button></label></div><p class="catalog-count" aria-live="polite">6种学习方式 · 正式内容以开放情况为准</p><div class="catalog-grid"><!--[--><a href="/courses/daily-words" class="course-card"><!--[--><div class="course-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-type">词汇与复习</span><span class="art-circle"></span><span class="art-typeface">Aa<small>+</small></span><span class="art-small">Little words. Lasting memories.</span></div><div class="course-content"><h2>日常词汇</h2><p>词卡、例句与到期复习，把熟悉变成记得。</p><div class="course-tags"><!--[--><span>主动回忆</span><span>生词本</span><span>规律复习</span><!--]--></div><div class="course-bottom"><span>了解学习方式</span><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></div></div><!--]--></a><a href="/courses/clear-grammar" class="course-card"><!--[--><div class="course-art sage" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-type">语法与规则</span><span class="art-circle"></span><span class="art-typeface">{ a }</span><span class="art-small">Make sense of a sentence.</span></div><div class="course-content"><h2>语法与句子</h2><p>拆开句子看结构，练习后查看规则与错因。</p><div class="course-tags"><!--[--><span>语法规则</span><span>句子结构</span><span>错因说明</span><!--]--></div><div class="course-bottom"><span>了解学习方式</span><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></div></div><!--]--></a><a href="/courses/listening" class="course-card"><!--[--><div class="course-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-type">听力与理解</span><span class="art-circle"></span><img src="/illustrations/coffee.svg" width="340" height="170" alt=""><span class="art-small">A little coffee break.</span></div><div class="course-content"><h2>听力精练</h2><p>字幕对照、慢速与循环，听清每一句。</p><div class="course-tags"><!--[--><span>字幕对照</span><span>变速复听</span><span>听写练习</span><!--]--></div><div class="course-bottom"><span>了解学习方式</span><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></div></div><!--]--></a><a href="/courses/reading" class="course-card"><!--[--><div class="course-art sage" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-type">阅读与理解</span><span class="art-circle"></span><span class="art-icon-wrap"><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5C8 2 4 3 2 4v16c3-1 6-1 10 1 4-2 7-2 10-1V4c-2-1-6-2-10 1Zm0 0v16"/></svg></span><span class="art-small">One page at a time.</span></div><div class="course-content"><h2>分级阅读</h2><p>读短文、查词句，用检查点确认理解。</p><div class="course-tags"><!--[--><span>分级内容</span><span>词句辅助</span><span>阅读检查点</span><!--]--></div><div class="course-bottom"><span>了解学习方式</span><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></div></div><!--]--></a><a href="/courses/speaking" class="course-card"><!--[--><div class="course-art apricot" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-type">口语练习</span><span class="art-circle"></span><span class="art-icon-wrap"><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="2" width="8" height="13" rx="4"/><path d="M5 10v2a7 7 0 0 0 14 0v-2M12 19v3m-3 0h6"/></svg></span><span class="art-small">Listen. Record. Reflect.</span></div><div class="course-content"><h2>口语自评</h2><p>跟读、录音、回放，按提示自己检查。</p><div class="course-tags"><!--[--><span>示范跟读</span><span>录音回放</span><span>自评提示</span><!--]--></div><div class="course-bottom"><span>了解学习方式</span><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></div></div><!--]--></a><a href="/courses/writing" class="course-card"><!--[--><div class="course-art apricot" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-type">写作与表达</span><span class="art-circle"></span><span class="art-icon-wrap"><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 4 5 5M4 20l5-1L21 7l-4-4L5 15Z"/></svg></span><span class="art-small">Find your words.</span></div><div class="course-content"><h2>写作练习</h2><p>从短句开始写，对照规则反馈再修改。</p><div class="course-tags"><!--[--><span>句子练习</span><span>规则反馈</span><span>修改回看</span><!--]--></div><div class="course-bottom"><span>了解学习方式</span><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></div></div><!--]--></a><!--]--><!----></div><section class="published-courses" aria-labelledby="published-courses-title"><div class="published-courses-header"><div><h2 id="published-courses-title">当前公开课程</h2><p class="catalog-note">这里介绍学习方式，具体课程以学习端已开放内容为准。</p></div><a href="http://127.0.0.1:18180/register?uiLocale=zh-CN&amp;theme=system&amp;returnTo=%2Fhome" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-arrow" data-register-entry>去注册<svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><!----><section class="public-status empty-state" role="alert" aria-live="polite"><svg class="icon" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="1